{
  "_comment": [
    "Personal mail profile: one person's own mailbox.",
    "",
    "You do not need this file. It is the built-in behaviour, written out so",
    "you can see what you are starting from and change one thing at a time.",
    "",
    "Compared with the enterprise profile: nothing here fires on ordinary",
    "personal mail. 'invoice', 'receipt' and 'meeting' are deliberately absent",
    "-- they appear constantly in harmless mail, so including them would make",
    "the alerts useless."
  ],

  "threat": {
